<title>UK: Yeoman Group seeks listing on UK's AIM market.</title>
<headline>Yeoman Group seeks listing on UK's AIM market.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yeoman Group Plc is to seek a listing on London Stock Exchange's Alternative Investment Market (AIM) by means of a placing raising up to 4.0 million stg, the company said on Monday.</p>
<p>Yeoman develops and markets devices that enable users to pinpoint their exact position on conventional paper maps using the U.S. government's Global Positioning System (GPS).</p>
<p>Most of the proceeds from the issue will be used to market the company's new land-based cordless system, which is about the size of a mobile phone.</p>
</text>
